      ],
      "excerpt": "## 4. Deaerator-related loss of suction\n\nIf both pumps trip on `BFP-SUCT-P-LL`, the cause is almost always the deaerator DA-101\n(low level or pressure). Restore DA-101 level and pressure first, then start one pump.",
      "source_path": "safety/SAF-002_loss_of_boiler_feedwater_emergency.md",
